+/**
+ * PUBLIC LIGHT LAYER (2026-10)
+ * The public site moved from a dark to a light palette. Many legacy components hardcode
+ * white text and dark gradients/overlays. Instead of a risky 100+ file rewrite, these rules
+ * neutralise those hardcoded utilities on public routes only (html.theme-light).
+ * Text that sits on a solid brand/colour button keeps its own colour.
